From 579b110ae33f2b68c1559c40f56729e27a7a2750 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: austin62jake <340374338+austin62jake@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:27:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): the G-code viewer lists every line from the left
 edge

add_sized centred each program line in its row, and let a line wider
than the window wrap onto a second row that put every row below it off
the scroll cursor (#256). Each row is now a left-to-right box of the
same width and height; a wide line truncates on its row and shows in
full on hover.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
